---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
const code = `<iframe src="${SITE_URL}/embed/credential-cost-comparator/" title="Finance certification cost comparator" width="100%" height="760" style="border:0;max-width:900px" loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
---
<PageLayout title="Embed the finance certification cost comparator on your site" description="Show the credential cost comparator on your own site for free: one iframe, CPA, CFA®, CFP®, EA, CIA and FRM® fees with retakes from published pass rates, no sign-up." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Embed', path: route('widget', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Embed' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <header class="mb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Embed the credential cost comparator</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-navy-700">For an accounting department’s career page, a student society or an article on finance careers: visitors pick a credential, a registration window and a prep budget, and see the expected total with retakes.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-navy-900 p-4 text-sm text-white"><code>{code}</code></pre>
    <p>Conditions: keep the credit and source lines under the comparator visible and use it as it is, without warranty. When a fee or a pass rate changes and the site is rebuilt, the embedded comparator follows.</p>
    <p>Nothing your visitors type reaches us and the frame sets no cookie. Questions: <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-navy-200"><iframe src="/embed/credential-cost-comparator/" title="Finance certification cost comparator" width="100%" height="760" style="border:0" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
</PageLayout>
